    "Current pull-request failures are listed separately and are not evidence that this optimisation caused or fixed them.",
    "Removing the unused experimental extra is a candidate supported by source inspection; full runtime validation belongs to the implementation.",
    "No single percentage or fixed end-to-end speedup can be inferred from these observations."
